        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Email }}",
        "subject": "=Lilac Grove Kindergarten Interview Update – {{ $json['Full Name'] }}",
        "message": "=<p>\n<img src=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=1ZsBGhPFwTZunY-ogkqEpwjzYEzfEjEA0\" alt=\"Lilac Grove Logo\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" style=\"display: block; margin-top: 10px;\" />\n</p>\n\n<p>Dear <strong>{{ $json['Full Name'] }}</strong>,</p>\n    \n    <p>Thank you very much for taking the time to attend the interview for the <strong>{{ $json['Position '] }}</strong> role at <strong>Lilac Grove Kindergarten</strong>. We truly appreciate the effort you put into the process and enjoyed getting to know you.</p>\n    \n    <p>After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that you have not been selected to move forward in the hiring process at this time.</p>\n    \n    <p>Please don’t be discouraged — this decision was not easy, and it does not reflect negatively on your skills or experience. We recognize your potential and encourage you to continue pursuing your professional goals with confidence and determination.</p>\n    \n    <p>Thank you once again for your interest in joining our team. We wish you all the best in your career journey ahead.</p>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">Warm regards,</p>\n    <p><strong>Ruby</strong><br>\n    HR Team<br>\n    Lilac Grove Kindergarten</p>",
