      "id": "dd4b3df3-9918-427e-aed9-48f6ac5f3453",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Determine if Passed Interview\n \n**Purpose:** Check whether a candidate has passed the interview.\n\n## Logic\n- If the `Passed Interview?` column is `Yes`, the candidate follows the **Yes** path.  \n- If the `Passed Interview?` column is `No`, the candidate follows the **No** path.\n\n## Usage\nThis node is used to branch the workflow based on interview results, allowing different actions for successful and unsuccessful candidates.\n",
        "height": 576,
        "width": 384
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        -336
      ],
      "id": "bfd9f4bc-dcb4-43a4-ba30-88e852e90511",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Offer Letter Automation\n\n**Purpose:** Automates the creation, editing, downloading, and emailing of offer letters to shortlisted candidates, and updates their status in the Google Sheet.\n\n1. **Copy Offer Letter Template**  \n   - Copies a pre-made offer letter template and renames it for the candidate.\n\n2. **Edit Offer Letter**  \n   - Replaces placeholders in the copied offer letter with the candidate's details:\n    \n3. **Download Offer Letter**  \n   - Downloads the edited offer letter as a PDF.\n\n4. **Send Email to Passed Candidate**  \n   - Sends the offer letter PDF to the candidate’s email with a personalized message.\n\n5. **Update Offer Letter Status**  \n   - Marks `Offer Letter Issued?` as \"Yes\" in the candidate's row in the Job Application Form.\n",
        "height": 656,
        "width": 1120,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        624,
        -560
      ],
      "id": "7c624649-a54f-42d2-81db-980449b084d5",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email for Unsuccessful Candidate\n\n**Purpose:** Automate Email to inform the candidates of their unsuccessful application.\n\n\n\n\n ",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 5
      },
